---
import TablerIcon from './ui/TablerIcon.astro';
import WhatsAppChatRuntime from './WhatsAppChatRuntime.astro';
---

<section class="relative pt-4 pb-14 md:pt-8 md:pb-20 overflow-hidden bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <WhatsAppChatRuntime>
      <!-- Main Headline -->
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-[42px] xl:text-[48px] font-bold text-content-main tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
        Tus tareas avanzan con solo un mensaje de <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap"><TablerIcon name="brand-whatsapp" size={40} strokeWidth={2.2} className="w-[0.9em] h-[0.9em] text-[#25D366] shrink-0" /><span>WhatsApp.</span></span>
      </h1>

      <!-- Secondary Subtitle -->
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-content-secondary leading-relaxed font-normal">
        Pídele que busque compras del Estado, emita tus facturas o consulte información de tu negocio. Todo desde tu chat de siempre, sin aprender programas difíciles.
      </p>

      <!-- Action Buttons -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3 pt-1">
        <a
          href="#empezar"
          class="btn-primary px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl text-base font-medium shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
        >
          <TablerIcon name="brand-whatsapp" size={19} strokeWidth={2} />
          <span>Probar gratis en WhatsApp</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="#como-funciona"
          class="btn-secondary px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl text-base font-medium text-center"
        >
          <span>Ver cómo funciona</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Micro Trust Points -->
      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-surface-border/80 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-xs text-content-muted">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="text-brand-forest font-bold">✓</span>
          <span>Sin contratos forzosos</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="text-brand-forest font-bold">✓</span>
          <span>Respuestas en segundos</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="text-brand-forest font-bold">✓</span>
          <span>100% en tu WhatsApp</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </WhatsAppChatRuntime>

  </div>
</section>
